ed in, and the middle is yours. [%csl Gd5,Ge6] } (6... b5 { The engine likes this too, grabbing room. } 7. Ne5 Bb7 8. O-O { Also equal. Castling first is the calmer road. }) (6... Nc6 { Fine as well. } 7. a4 O-O 8. O-O { You castle anyway, one move later. }) (6... a6 { A quiet breath while your king waits in the middle. } 7. O-O Nc6 8. Bf4 { He is first to every good square. }) (6... h6 { Nothing is threatening you. Get the king in. } 7. O-O O-O 8. c4 { A wasted move against a slow plan. }) 0-1


